(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**SCH is hybrid by design.** Light Arts → cures/enhancing/divine. Dark Arts → nukes/enfeebles/dark. Stratagems (Penury/Celerity/Alacrity/Parsimony/Modus Veritas/Helix/Klimaform) shape your weather. Subliminal MP via **Sublimation** = self-sufficient mage.

{{toc/}}

